  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protergia Mini-Grid Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Solar.Summary: With the support of USADF, Protergia will deploy a solar-powered mini-grid to distribute and sell electricity to residents of Idanre Local Government Area, Ondo State. The mini-grid will principally target commercial entities and small businesses like barbers, tailors and pharmacies.</narrative>
  </description>
